> Jaroslav Kysela, on Wed 17 Aug 2016 19:46:42 +0200, wrote:
> > Dne 16.8.2016 v 23:03 Samuel Thibault napsal(a):
> > > - snd_pcm_new seems to initialize pcm->thread_safe to 0 by default, this
